<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-16T22:24:02.706Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 22:24:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits in Zamfara burned 11 family members to death and abducted five children from the same family while also attacking a mosque during Subhi prayer, killing Governor Dauda Lawal's aide and abducting worshippers. In Plateau, gunmen killed herders, farmers and an Operation Rainbow commander, set seven houses ablaze and forced the local government to impose a curfew. President Tinubu sought forgiveness for his absence after the Plateau attack and announced a five-year defence plan as AI-generated disinformation spreads ahead of the election. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/nigeria-s-upcoming-election-marred-by-rising-ai-disinformation/a-79946897?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxPM0ZmYTRGRFlDYW8tejdiSnZEU0NKWnZHZG5GY0lDRmZGQjYyRVc5Ty1vNE1Lbll6WVVIY0kzYzF6Rzd2VDMtQkFnTEY3dFBGQzVZczY0YjBBV0dfMUg4RW1kVHVvS2ZDTUlqWnMyeHdGSVliV2ZkTVJpU0xOLU13OWlLaTBOcjg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTFBNeVpvTFo2c1pmVmNhWXpTOC1oRGxTQkIwTllCN2w3MXRFVFp0Q2x5TVg4UV9kUWRkQUNSN25ocDZWd0QxSlVSTFV3T0NvaFhJZUlFTHVxVVpfTHZQMEFkR0Z2d3NlQXF6NGlmZDFiVWVESXZ3dWVtTEUwQWZXTlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxNZzdMUWFYcFVpV3BZODYwcGdaUGhzYlJIQ3hPdjVBd1VUM09vT2JVUEhIUEtaOC1yVkVIQ2R6YWNnUXUxYkk2S0VXRWVLQ1V1X2J6YWZfakdIYzlvQnhpeTBpcFk5Z0tnQ2xHUzBqSENESUYtZktqYzI3dUhubHY2dHlPLUhTVDNJRE9lbHhQYk84bU9UX0hGc0RWZ2JjOGhRUTFoN3k1Tk5lZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPQlR2dHlKVUFFZ0oyWHNFMmNuaVVJMHRNTHIwaXZKTk1CVkJ6e